And we haven't talked about how we're going to start disposing of these batteries yet. And so this, so you talk about the ideological reasons behind it, but really you can't say that because it's not even that it's a feeling because there's no common sense. There is absolutely no idea or no rational reason why they would want to go down this path. And then is still good.",
